  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming robusta coffee agroforestry to improve resilience of smallholders to adapt and mitigate climate change in Uganda project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project proposes an integrated and comprehensive Coffee Agroforestry approach as a contribution to Ugandas national strategy against global warming. Current knowledge on C-Af production system recognizes its capacity to address climate change issues(through adaptation, mitigation and resilience), and to offer sustainable development options to smallholder farmers. It represents a valuable strategy to protect coffee production sector against the immediate effect of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
